<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Document</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>Action Attribute</h1>

    <p> Action Attribute is used to define what action needs to be performed when a form is submitted or where the form data to be sent</p>

    <form action="submit.html" method="post"> 
        <input type="time" />
        <input type="checkbox"/>
        <input type="color"/>
        <button type="submit">Submit</button>
        <button type="reset">Reset</button>
        <button type="button" onclick="alert('Hello Pushkar!')">Click Me</button>
    </form>
</body>
</html>
